      "meaning": "非法的参数 / 参数不合法: 请输入正确sku_id或sku_code（sub_code: isv.parameter-invalid:20011）",
      "action": "请检查参数后重试",
      "sub_code": "isv.parameter-invalid:20011",
      "sub_msg": "参数不合法: 请输入正确sku_id或sku_code"
    },
    {
      "code": "50002",
      "meaning": "业务处理失败 / 商品信息获取异常: 获取库存数失败（sub_code: isv.business-failed:20100）",
      "action": "请稍后重试",
      "sub_code": "isv.business-failed:20100",
